---
import { COMPARE_ROWS, COMPARE_DATE, COMPARE_ASOF } from "../data/compare";
---
<div class="table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Comparison table" tabindex="0">
  <table class="compare compare-4">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th scope="col"><span class="sr-only">Feature</span></th>
        <th scope="col" class="us">Showsteps</th>
        <th scope="col">Mimik</th>
        <th scope="col">Scribe</th>
        <th scope="col">Tango</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {COMPARE_ROWS.map((r) => (
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">{r.feature}</th>
          <td class="us">{r.showsteps}</td>
          <td data-asof={COMPARE_ASOF}>{r.mimik}</td>
          <td data-asof={COMPARE_ASOF}>{r.scribe}</td>
          <td data-asof={COMPARE_ASOF}>{r.tango}</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
<p class="table-note">
  Details come from each vendor's own pricing, security and documentation pages, and from Mimik's README, as they were on <time datetime={COMPARE_ASOF}>{COMPARE_DATE}</time>.
  Plans and prices change; check their sites before deciding. Mimik is a free, MIT-licensed extension with video and GIF export and Firefox
  and Edge support that Showsteps does not have; see the <a href="/open-source-scribe-alternative/">full comparison</a>. Scribe, Tango and Mimik
  are trademarks of their owners, and Showsteps is not affiliated with any of them.
</p>
